<title>USA: GranCare makes cash tender for senior note.</title>
<headline>GranCare makes cash tender for senior note.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>GranCare Inc said Wednesday it had begun a cash tender for all of its outstanding $100 million in aggregate principal of 9-3/8 percent Senior Subordinated Notes due 2005.</p>
<p>GranCare said the tender was in connection with the proposed acquisition of its institutional pharmacy business by Vitalink Pharmacy Services Inc.</p>
<p>It said the purchase price per $1,000 principal amount of Notes validly tendered will be $1,090 plus accrued and unpaid interest up to the payment date.</p>
<p>The tender offer and consent solicitation will remain open until midnight, January 16, it added.</p>
</text>
